            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "This case concerns whether 47\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7253(a) preempts state laws that restrict entities, including municipal utilities, from providing telecommunications services."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner Nixon",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0cbead4345c3f09ffab1f492919f31e67d39147515eb0288eef7e75a8d6210f1",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0cbead4345c3-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 16,
              "start": 16
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "0cbead4345c3f09ffab1f492919f31e67d39147515eb0288eef7e75a8d6210f1",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0cbead4345c3-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The parties argue about the meaning of \u201cany entity\u201d in the statute and whether it includes political subdivisions such as municipal corporations."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
